1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,602
AI isn’t taking the last job. It’s taking the first one.

2
00:00:04,652 --> 00:00:07,031
Your first job used to be the boring part.

3
00:00:07,081 --> 00:00:10,742
Coffee. Spreadsheets. First drafts. That’s how you learned.

4
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:13,226
But now AI does the boring part.

5
00:00:13,276 --> 00:00:16,564
So companies hire fewer beginners.

6
00:00:16,614 --> 00:00:22,848
One study: young workers in AI-exposed jobs are 19% behind their peers.

7
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:25,513
Experienced workers? No gap.

8
00:00:25,563 --> 00:00:28,003
So if nobody starts at the bottom…

9
00:00:28,163 --> 00:00:29,403
who becomes the expert?
